---
---

<!-- Ballot Access War -->
<section class="ballot-fight section-padding" id="ballot-fight">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label animate-in" style="text-align:center;display:block;" data-i18n="machine.fight_label">The Fight Is Here</span>
    <h2 class="section-title animate-in" style="text-align:center;" data-i18n="machine.fight_headline">The Ballot Battle</h2>

    <div class="fight-grid">
      <div class="fight-context animate-in">
        <p class="fight-text" data-i18n="machine.fight_p1">
          The machine could not stop the movement at the doorstep, so now it is trying to stop it in a hearing room. Illinois election law required Byron to collect 10,816 valid signatures, while the machine's anointed candidate needed only 697. Volunteers answered with 22,788 signatures, more than double the legal requirement, filed with the Illinois State Board of Elections.
        </p>
        <p class="fight-text" data-i18n="machine.fight_p2">
          So the machine did exactly what we warned it would do. On June 9, 2026, an objection was filed with the Illinois State Board of Elections seeking to invalidate the people's signatures and remove Byron from the November ballot, a process that could drag into the first week of August. They are paying lawyers to comb through every sheet, challenging every misspelled name and every address one digit off, hoping to erase 22,788 voices one line at a time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="fight-numbers animate-in">
        <div class="fight-stat">
          <span class="fight-stat-number">697</span>
          <span class="fight-stat-label" data-i18n="machine.stat_machine">Signatures the machine's candidate needed</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fight-stat-vs">vs.</div>
        <div class="fight-stat fight-stat-movement">
          <span class="fight-stat-number">10,816</span>
          <span class="fight-stat-label" data-i18n="machine.stat_required">Valid signatures the law demanded of Byron</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fight-stat-vs">→</div>
        <div class="fight-stat fight-stat-target">
          <span class="fight-stat-number">22,788</span>
          <span class="fight-stat-label" data-i18n="machine.stat_needed">Signatures the movement delivered, more than double</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Framing -->
    <div class="fight-framing animate-in">
      <p class="fight-framing-text" data-i18n="machine.fight_framing">
        This challenge is not about election integrity. It is the machine telling 22,788 of your neighbors their signatures don't count. Every volunteer who joins this fight is a direct answer: you don't get to choose for us. Let the people decide.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA Block -->
<section class="machine-cta-block">
  <div class="machine-cta-bg">
    <div class="machine-cta-pattern"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container machine-cta-content">
    <h2 class="machine-cta-headline animate-in" data-i18n="machine.cta_headline">They're Trying to Erase Your Choice. Fight Back.</h2>
    <div class="machine-cta-buttons animate-in">
      <a href="#petition" class="btn btn-orange btn-massive" data-i18n="machine.cta_petition">Join the Fight</a>
      <a href="https://secure.actblue.com/donate/byronfor04web/" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-i18n="machine.cta_donate">Fund the Legal Defense</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ballot-fight {
    background: var(--cream);
    position: relative;
  }

  .fight-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3xl);
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .fight-text {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--gray-700);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .fight-text:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Signature Stats */
  .fight-numbers {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    padding: var(--space-2xl);
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    border: 2px solid rgba(5, 173, 237, 0.1);
  }

  .fight-stat {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .fight-stat-number {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-4xl);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--blue);
    display: block;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .fight-stat-movement .fight-stat-number {
    color: var(--orange);
  }

  .fight-stat-target .fight-stat-number {
    font-size: var(--text-5xl);
    color: var(--orange);
    text-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(230, 136, 28, 0.2);
  }

  .fight-stat-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--gray-500);
    display: block;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .fight-stat-vs {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  /* Framing */
  .fight-framing {
    margin-top: var(--space-3xl);
    padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-2xl);
    background: var(--white);
    border-left: 5px solid var(--orange);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .fight-framing-text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* CTA Block */
  .machine-cta-block {
    position: relative;
    padding: var(--space-4xl) 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .machine-cta-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--blue) 0%, var(--blue-deeper) 100%);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .machine-cta-pattern {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    opacity: 0.04;
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
  }

  .machine-cta-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .machine-cta-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--cream);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .machine-cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .fight-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .fight-stat-target .fight-stat-number {
      font-size: var(--text-4xl);
    }

    .machine-cta-buttons {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .machine-cta-buttons .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
